 "v": 1,
 "about": "Pots at the end of a hand. put_in = every chip each seat put in this hand (blinds included). First the uncalled part of the single biggest put-in (over the second biggest, folded seats included) goes back. Then one pot per distinct put-in level of the seats still in (ascending), taking from every seat (folded too) up to that level; eligible = seats still in whose put-in reaches it. Chips above the highest level reached by a seat still in (put in only by folded seats) join the top pot, so nothing is ever left over. Neighbouring pots with the same eligible seats merge. Each pot goes to the strongest eligible group in ranking; a split pot's odd chips go one each to its winners in clockwise order starting with the first seat after the button. Chips are whole numbers; nothing is created or lost.",
